hadiths[27]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3939","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : is duniya mein auratein aur khushbu merey liye mehboob banai gai hain, aur meri aankhon ki thandak namaz mein rakhi gai hai."
"3940","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : auratein aur khushbu merey liye mehboob banai gai hain, lekin meri aankhon ki thandak namaz mein rakhi gai hai."
"3941","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : aurton key baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko ghoron sey zyada koi cheez mehboob na thi."
"3942","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis ki do biwiyan hon aur woh ek ki taraf jhuk kar dusri par usey tarjeeh dey, woh qiyamat key din is haal mein aaye ga ke is ka aadha badan jhuka hua ho ga."
"3943","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) apni biwiyon key darmiyan barabar barabar waqt taqseem farmatey, phir farmatey : aey Allah ! ye woh hai jo main ney is muamley mein kiya jis par mera ikhtiyar hai, to is muamley mein mujhey malamat na farma jis par tera ikhtiyar hai aur mera nahin. Hammad bin Zaid ney isey mursal taur par riwayat kiya."
"3944","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki biwiyon ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki beti Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas bheja. unhoney andar aaney ki ijazat maangi jab ke aap merey saath meri chadar key neechey letey hue they. aap ney unhein andar aaney ki ijazat di, to unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasul ! aap ki biwiyon ney mujhey aap key paas Abu-Quhafa ki beti key muamley mein insaaf karney ki darkhwast key liye bheja hai. main (Ayesha) khamosh rahi aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney un sey farmaya : aey meri beti ! kya tum is sey muhabbat nahin karti jis sey main muhabbat karta hun ? unhoney kaha : han. aap ney farmaya : to is sey muhabbat karo. Fatima ye sun kar khari huin aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas sey chali gain, aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki biwiyon key paas wapis gain. unhoney unhein bataya ke unhoney kya kaha tha aur aap ney un sey kya farmaya tha. unhoney un sey kaha : hamein nahin lagta ke tum hamarey kisi kaam aain. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas wapis jaao aur un sey kaho : aap ki biwiyan Abu-Quhafa ki beti key muamley mein insaaf ki darkhwast kar rahi hain. Fatima ney kaha : nahin, Allah ki qism ! main un key barey mein un sey kabhi baat nahin karun gi. Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki biwiyon ney Zainab bint Jahsh (Raziallahu anha) ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas bheja; Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki nazar mein rutbey mein woh kuch had tak merey barabar thin. aur main ney Zainab sey barh kar deendari mein behtar, Allah sey zyada darney wali, baat mein zyada sacchi, sila-rehmi nibhaney mein zyada paband, sadqa deney mein zyada sakhi, aur sadqey key kaamon mein apni jaan khapaney mein zyada lagi hui koi aurat nahin dekhi, jin sey woh Allah ka qurb chahti thin. lekin woh jaldi ghussey mein aa jati thin; halanke jald pursukun bhi ho jati thin. unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas andar aaney ki ijazat maangi jab ke aap Ayesha key saath un ki chadar key neechey they, usi haalat mein jaisey Fatima aai thin. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhein andar aaney ki ijazat di aur unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasul ! aap ki biwiyon ney mujhey Abu-Quhafa ki beti key muamley mein insaaf ki darkhwast key liye bheja hai. phir woh mujhey lambi chauri bura bhala kehney lagin, aur main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko dekh rahi thi ke kya woh mujhey jawab deney ki ijazat dein gey. Zainab kehti rahin yahan tak ke mujhey samajh aa gaya ke agar main jawab dun to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) napasand nahin farmayein gey. phir main ney un sey is tarah baat ki ke unhein khamosh kar diya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : woh Abu-Bakr ki beti hai."
"3945","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) sey milti julti riwayat zikr ki gai aur unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki biwiyon ney Zainab (Raziallahu anha) ko bheja aur unhoney andar aaney ki ijazat maangi aur woh andar aain. aur unhoney kuch aisi hi baat kahi. Mamar ney un donon ki mukhalifat ki; unhoney isey Zuhri sey, Urwa sey, Ayesha sey riwayat kiya."
"3946","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki biwiyan ikatthi huin aur Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas bheja. unhoney un sey kaha ke kahein : aap ki biwiyan — aur rawi ney kuch is mafhum ki baat kahi ke woh Abu-Quhafa ki beti key muamley mein insaaf ki darkhwast kar rahi hain. unhoney farmaya : to woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aain jab ke aap Ayesha key saath un ki chadar key neechey they. unhoney un sey kaha : aap ki biwiyon ney mujhey bheja hai aur woh Abu-Quhafa ki beti key muamley mein insaaf ki darkhwast kar rahi hain. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney un sey farmaya : kya tum mujh sey muhabbat karti ho ? unhoney kaha : han. aap ney farmaya : to is sey muhabbat karo. to woh un key paas wapis gain aur unhein bataya ke aap ney kya farmaya. unhoney un sey kaha : tum ney kuch nahin kiya; un key paas wapis jaao. unhoney kaha : Allah ki qism ! main un key barey mein (baat karney) kabhi wapis nahin jaun gi. woh sach mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki beti thin. to unhoney Zainab bint Jahsh (Raziallahu anha) ko bheja. Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki biwiyon mein kuch had tak meri barabar thin. unhoney kaha : aap ki biwiyon ney mujhey Abu-Quhafa ki beti key muamley mein insaaf ki darkhwast key liye bheja hai. phir woh mujh par jhaptin aur mujhey bura bhala kaha, aur main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko dekhney lagi ke kya woh mujhey unhein jawab deney ki ijazat dein gey. unhoney mujhey bura kaha aur main sochney lagi ke agar main unhein jawab dun to woh napasand nahin farmayein gey. to main ney unhein bura kaha aur jald unhein khamosh kar diya. phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney un sey farmaya : woh Abu-Bakr ki beti hai. Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : aur main ney Zainab sey barh kar koi aurat nahin dekhi jo behtar ho, sadqa deney mein zyada sakhi ho, sila-rehmi nibhaney ki zyada harees ho, aur har is cheez mein apni jaan kharch karney mein zyada sakhi ho jin sey woh Allah ka qurb hasil kar sakti thin. lekin un mein jaldi ghussa tha; halanke woh jald pursukun bhi ho jati thin."
"3947","Hazrat Abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : dusri aurton par Ayesha ki fazeelat aisi hai jaisey dusrey khanon par sareed (shorbey mein chur roti) ki fazeelat."
"3948","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : dusri aurton par Ayesha ki fazeelat aisi hai jaisey dusrey khanon par sareed ki fazeelat."
"3949","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey Umme-Salama ! Ayesha key barey mein mujhey takleef na do, kyun ke Allah ki qism ! is key siwa tum mein sey kisi key lihaaf mein merey paas kabhi wahi nahin aai."
"3950","Hazrat Umme-Salama (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki biwiyon ney un sey kaha ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey baat karein aur un sey kahein ke log apna hadiya is waqt laney ki koshish kartey hain jab Ayesha ki baari hoti hai, aur un sey kahein : hum bhi achhi cheezon ko itna hi pasand karti hain jitna Ayesha karti hain. to unhoney un sey baat ki, lekin aap ney unhein koi jawab na diya. jab un ki baari phir aai, unhoney phir baat ki, lekin aap ney unhein koi jawab na diya. unhoney un sey kaha : unhoney kya jawab diya ? unhoney kaha : unhoney mujhey koi jawab nahin diya. unhoney kaha : unhein akela na chhoro yahan tak ke woh tumhein jawab dein ya tum samajh lo ke woh kya kehtey hain. jab un ki baari phir aai, unhoney un sey baat ki aur aap ney farmaya : Ayesha key barey mein mujhey takleef na do, kyun ke Ayesha key lihaaf key siwa tum mein sey kisi key lihaaf mein merey paas kabhi wahi nahin aai."
"3951","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : log (Nabi Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam ko) apna hadiya Ayesha ki baari mein laney ki koshish kartey they, is ummeed mein ke is sey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki khushnudi hasil karein."
"3952","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jab main un key saath thi to Allah ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) par wahi nazil farmai, to main uthhi aur un key aur apney darmiyan darwaza band kar diya. jab woh un sey utar gai to unhoney mujh sey farmaya : aey Ayesha ! Jibril tumhein salaam bhejtey hain."
"3953","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney un sey farmaya : Jibril tumhein salaam bhejtey hain. unhoney kaha : aur un par salamti aur Allah ki rehmat aur un ki barkatein hon; aap dekhtey hain jo hum nahin dekhtey."
"3954","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey Ayesha ! ye Jibril hain aur woh tumhein salaam bhej rahey hain. usi tarah."
"3955","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Ummahatul-Momineen mein sey ek key paas they jab dusri ney lakri ka pyala bheja jis mein kuch khana tha. unhoney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key haath par mara aur pyala gir kar tut gaya. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney donon tukrey uthaye aur unhein jor diya, phir khana sametney lagey aur farmaya : tumhari maan ko ghairat aa gai; khaao. to unhoney khaya. aap rukey rahey yahan tak ke woh lakri ka pyala lain jo un key ghar mein tha, phir aap ney sahi-salim pyala qasid ko dey diya aur tuta hua pyala is ghar mein chhor diya jis ney usey tora tha."
"3956","Hazrat Umme-Salama (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) aur un key sahaba key liye apney bartan mein kuch khana lain, phir Ayesha ek kaprey mein lipti huin, pathar ki musli ley kar aain aur bartan tor diya. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney bartan key tutey tukrey sametey aur farmaya : khaao; tumhari maan ko ghairat aa gai, do baar. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Ayesha ka bartan liya aur usey Umme-Salama key paas bheja aur Umme-Salama ka bartan Ayesha ko dey diya."
"3957","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main ney Safiyya jaisa khana bananey wali koi aurat nahin dekhi. unhoney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko ek bartan bheja jis mein kuch khana tha, aur main khud ko usey torney sey rok na saki. main ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey puchha ke is key liye kaffara kya hai, to aap ney farmaya : is bartan jaisa bartan, aur is khaney jaisa khana."
"3958","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Zainab bint Jahsh (Raziallahu anha) key paas tehertey aur un key ghar shehed peetey they. Hafsa aur main ney tay kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) hum donon mein sey jis key paas bhi aayein, woh kahey gi : mujhey aap sey Maghafir (badbudar gond) ki bu aa rahi hai; kya aap ney Maghafir khaya hai ? aap un mein sey ek key paas aaye, to unhoney aap sey ye kaha. aap ney farmaya : nahin, balke main ney Zainab bint Jahsh key ghar shehed piya hai, lekin main phir kabhi aisa nahin karun ga. phir ye nazil hua : aey Nabi ! aap apney liye woh kyun haraam kartey hain jo Allah ney aap key liye halal kiya. agar tum donon Allah ki taraf tauba karo (to tumharey liye behtar ho ga) — Ayesha aur Hafsa key barey mein, aur (yaad karo) jab Nabi ney apni ek biwi sey raaz ki baat kahi — is sey murad un ka ye farmana hai : nahin, balke main ney shehed piya hai."
"3959","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki ek laundi thin jin sey aap sohbat farmatey they, lekin Ayesha aur Hafsa aap ko na chhorti thin yahan tak ke aap ney keh diya ke woh aap par haraam hain. phir Allah Azza wa Jalla ney nazil farmaya : aey Nabi ! aap apney liye woh kyun haraam kartey hain jo Allah ney aap key liye halal kiya — aayat key aakhir tak."
"3960","Hazrat Ubada bin Waleed bin Ubada bin Samit sey riwayat hai ke Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : main ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko talash kiya aur main ney apna haath un key baalon par rakha. aap ney farmaya : tumhara shaitan tumharey paas aa gaya hai. main ney kaha : kya aap ka shaitan nahin hai ? aap ney farmaya : han, lekin Allah ney is key muqabley mein meri madad farmai, to woh farmabardar ho gaya."
"3961","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main ney ek raat dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) wahan nahin hain, aur main ney socha ke woh apni dusri biwiyon mein sey kisi key paas gaye hain, to main ney un key liye haath barhaya, aur unhein ruku ya sajdey mein paya, aur woh keh rahey they : Subhanaka wa bi-hamdika la-ilaha illa anta (paak hai Tu aur Teri hamd key saath, Terey siwa koi mabood nahin). main ney kaha : merey maan-baap aap par fida hon; aap ek kaam kar rahey they, aur main kuch aur soch rahi thi."
"3962","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : main ney ek raat dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) wahan nahin hain, aur main ney socha ke woh apni dusri biwiyon mein sey kisi key paas gaye hain. main ney unhein talash kiya phir main wapis aai, aur woh they, ruku ya sajdey mein aur keh rahey they : Subhanaka wa bi-hamdika la-ilaha illa anta (paak hai Tu aur Teri hamd key saath, Terey siwa koi mabood nahin). main ney kaha : merey maan-baap aap par fida hon; aap ek kaam kar rahey they aur main kuch aur soch rahi thi."
"3963","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : kya main tumhein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) aur apney barey mein na bataun ? hum ney kaha : han. unhoney farmaya : jab meri baari ki raat thi, woh andar aaye, apney jutey apney pairon key paas rakhey, apni chadar (uper ka kapra) utaar kar rakhi, aur apney tehband (neechey ka kapra) ko apney bistar par bichhaya. jyon hi unhein laga ke main so gai hun, unhoney aahista sey apney jutey pehney aur aahista sey apni chadar uthai. phir aahista sey darwaza khola, bahar gaye aur aahista sey band kiya. main ney apna kapra apney sir par daala, khud ko dhanpa aur apna tehband pehna, aur un key peechey chal pari yahan tak ke woh Baqee pahunchey, teen baar haath uthaye aur wahan lambi der kharey rahey. phir woh chaley aur main chali, woh tez chaley aur main tez chali, woh daurey aur main dauri, aur main un sey pehley pahunch gai aur (ghar mein) dakhil ho gai. main abhi leti hi thi ke woh andar aaye aur farmaya : aey Ayesha ! tumhein saans kyun phul rahi hai ? (rawiyon mein sey) Suleman ney kaha : mera khayal hai ke unhoney (Ibne-Wahab ney) kaha : saans chhoti ho rahi hai. aap ney farmaya : ya to tum mujhey batao ya sab janney wala, sab khabar rakhney wala mujhey bata dey ga. main ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasul ! merey maan-baap aap par fida hon; aur main ney unhein qissa sunaya. aap ney farmaya : kya tum hi woh siyah saya thin jisey main ney apney saamney dekha ? main ney kaha : han. unhoney farmaya : unhoney merey seeney mein dhakka diya jis sey mujhey takleef hui aur farmaya : tum ney socha ke Allah aur un key Rasul tum sey nainsafi karein gey. unhoney farmaya : log jo kuch chhipatey hain, Allah Azza wa Jalla usey janta hai. aap ney farmaya : han. aap ney farmaya : Jibril merey paas aaye jab tum ney (mujhey nikaltey) dekha lekin woh tumharey paas andar nahin aaye kyun ke tum ney apney kaprey utaar diye they. to unhoney mujhey pukara lekin unhoney khud ko tum sey chhipaya, aur main ney unhein jawab diya lekin main ney usey tum sey chhipaya. main ney socha ke tum so gai ho aur main tumhein jagana nahin chahta tha aur mujhey dar tha ke tum tanha mehsoos karo gi. unhoney mujhey Baqee jaaney aur un key liye maghfirat ki dua karney ko kaha. Hajjaj bin Muhammad ney un ki (Ibne-Wahab ki) mukhalifat ki, unhoney kaha : Ibne-Juraij sey, Ibne-Abi-Mulaika sey, Muhammad bin Qais sey."
"3964","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : kya main tumhein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) aur apney barey mein na bataun ? hum ney kaha : han. unhoney farmaya : jab meri baari ki raat thi jab woh — yani Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) — merey saath they, woh andar aaye, apney jutey apney pairon key paas rakhey, apni chadar (uper ka kapra) utaar kar rakhi, aur apney tehband (neechey ka kapra) ka kinara apney bistar par bichhaya. jyon hi unhein laga ke main so gai hun, unhoney aahista sey apney jutey pehney, aur aahista sey apni chadar uthai. phir aahista sey darwaza khola, bahar gaye aur aahista sey band kiya. main ney apna kapra apney sir par daala, khud ko dhanpa aur apna tehband pehna, aur un key peechey chal pari yahan tak ke woh Baqee pahunchey, teen baar haath uthaye aur wahan lambi der kharey rahey. phir woh chaley aur main chali, woh tez chaley aur main tez chali, woh daurey aur main dauri, aur main un sey pehley pahunch gai aur (ghar mein) dakhil ho gai. main abhi leti hi thi ke woh andar aaye aur farmaya : aey Ayesha ! tumhein saans kyun phul rahi hai ? unhoney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : ya to tum mujhey batao ya Allah, sab janney wala, sab khabar rakhney wala, mujhey bata dey ga. main ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasul ! merey maan-baap aap par fida hon; aur main ney unhein qissa sunaya. aap ney farmaya : kya tum hi woh siyah saya thin jisey main ney apney saamney dekha ? main ney kaha : han. unhoney farmaya : unhoney merey seeney mein dhakka diya jis sey mujhey takleef hui aur farmaya : tum ney socha ke Allah aur un key Rasul tum sey nainsafi karein gey. unhoney farmaya : log jo kuch chhipatey hain, Allah usey janta hai. aap ney farmaya : han. aap ney farmaya : Jibril merey paas aaye jab tum ney (mujhey nikaltey) dekha lekin woh tumharey paas andar nahin aaye kyun ke tum ney apney kaprey utaar diye they. to unhoney mujhey pukara lekin unhoney khud ko tum sey chhipaya, aur main ney unhein jawab diya, lekin main ney usey tum sey chhipaya. main ney socha ke tum so gai ho aur main tumhein jagana nahin chahta tha, aur mujhey dar tha ke tum tanha mehsoos karo gi. unhoney mujhey Baqee jaaney aur un key liye maghfirat ki dua karney ko kaha. Aasim ney isey Abdullah bin Aamir sey, Ayesha sey, is sey mukhtalif alfaz key saath riwayat kiya."
"3965","Hazrat Ayesha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main ney ek raat dekha ke woh wahan nahin hain — aur unhoney baqi hadees zikr ki."
